{
    "id":  10644,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Fixed Circular Ring for GU10-MR16 - Cut-out Ø64mm - BLACK",
    "reference":  "91818",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eAluminum \u003cstrong\u003ecircular ring\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eblack\u003c/strong\u003e finish, elegant and exclusive design. The ring is designed for use of LED dichroic \u003cstrong\u003eGU10\u003c/strong\u003e or \u003cstrong\u003eMR16\u003c/strong\u003e. It is perfect for a new construction or to change the bulbs. It is manufactured for installation in indoor areas such as bedrooms, hallways, living rooms or storage rooms.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#fc0202;\"\u003eCOMPATIBLE ONLY WITH LED BULBS, OTHER TYPES OF TECHNOLOGY MAY CAUSE DAMAGE TO THE INSTALLATION\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eFixed Circular Ring for GU10-MR16 - Cut-out Ø64mm - BLACK\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlack recessed ring\u003c/strong\u003e for \u003cstrong\u003eLED dichroic\u003c/strong\u003e lamps, both \u003cstrong\u003eMR16\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eGU10\u003c/strong\u003e, designed to achieve an attractive and refined decoration. Thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003ecircular\u003c/strong\u003e shape you can create very exclusive environments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is made of aluminum with a black finish, which makes this ring a very resistant and long-lasting product: a \u003cstrong\u003erust-proof ring\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstallation requires a \u003cstrong\u003eØ64mm ceiling cut-out\u003c/strong\u003e. The ring measures Ø85mm x H52mm and is held firmly in place by its clips. If your opening is different, this same ring is also available with a Ø75mm cut-out (ref. 91822).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications of the Fixed Circular Ring for GU10-MR16 - Cut-out Ø64mm - BLACK\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBedrooms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLiving room\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePorches\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffices\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHypermarkets\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is ideal for any event area where select atmospheres need to be recreated. It can also withstand outdoor spaces thanks to its material.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
